---
description: Working with a CitePress CMS site through its MCP tools
alwaysApply: false
---

- CitePress CMS tools act on one site, with the signed-in admin's permissions.
- Draft first; publish, schedule, delete or change many items only after the person says so, then send
  `confirm: true` where the tool asks for it.
- Never ask for passwords or tokens in the chat; sign-in happens in the browser.
- If the site says its licence is needed for AI access, pass the message on as it is, link included.
